# 3. PROPOSED WAITER FLOW

The assigned waiter should eventually have a limited operational interface.

Potential actions:

- view orders assigned to that waiter;
- Mark Preparing;
- Mark Ready / Ready to Serve where applicable;
- Mark Completed after serving the customer.

The waiter must NOT automatically receive full Restaurant Dashboard privileges.

Investigate how this can be enforced at both UI and backend/data-access levels.

Do NOT assume hiding frontend buttons is sufficient authorization.

